{"id": "e80f2837-712f-4d8c-ab65-7d8133223ed9", "slug": "typeface-75-premium-mechanical-keyboard-1", "title": "Typeface 75 - Premium Mechanical Keyboard", "description": "Typeface Premium UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Typeface 75 - Premium Mechanical Keyboard\"\ndescription: \"Typeface Premium UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#ED724C\"\n  secondary: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  accent: \"#D8613C\"\n  background: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  surface: \"#E5E7EB\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#D1D5DB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"18px\"\n  control: \"17px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Typeface 75 - Premium Mechanical Keyboard\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 52; favorites: 17; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nTypeface Premium UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nTypeface 75 Overview Design Tech Specs Pre-order Award-winning layout Engineered for tactile precision. A completely re-imagined seventy-five percent layout. Featured In The Verge Wired TechCrunch\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #ED724C, secondary #FAFAFA, accent #D8613C, background #FAFAFA, surface #E5E7EB, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Typeface 75 - Premium Mechanical Keyboard</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#FAFAFA] text-gray-800 font-['Inter'] relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-orange-200 selection:text-orange-900\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between bg-[#FAFAFA]/70 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-200/50\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-700 to-gray-900 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:keyboard-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900\">Typeface 75</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs font-medium text-gray-500\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Overview</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Design</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Tech Specs</a>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <button class=\"text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors shadow-sm\">\n                Pre-order\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Mini Squares -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center w-full\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-6xl flex justify-between px-4 sm:px-8 relative h-full\">\n            <!-- Line 1 -->\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gray-200 to-transparent relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -left-[2.5px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-gray-300 bg-[#FAFAFA]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 -left-[2.5px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-gray-300 bg-[#FAFAFA]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Line 2 -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:block w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gray-200 to-transparent relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/3 -left-[2.5px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-gray-300 bg-[#FAFAFA]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Line 3 -->\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gray-200 to-transparent relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -left-[2.5px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-gray-300 bg-[#FAFAFA]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 -left-[2.5px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-gray-300 bg-[#FAFAFA]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-12\">\n\n        <!-- Masked Reveal Header -->\n        <div class=\"mb-16 text-center px-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Added Eyebrow -->\n            <div id=\"reveal-eyebrow\" class=\"opacity-0 translate-y-4 mb-6\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-200/80 rounded-full shadow-sm\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:crown-star-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-orange-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Award-winning layout\n                </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-2 sm:gap-x-3 overflow-hidden\" id=\"reveal-title\">\n                <!-- Words will be injected here by JS for staggered reveal -->\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-500 font-normal max-w-md mx-auto opacity-0 translate-y-4\" id=\"reveal-subtitle\">\n                Engineered for tactile precision. A completely re-imagined seventy-five percent layout.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- The Keyboard (Recreated exactly from reference) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl px-4 flex justify-center overflow-x-auto pb-12 pt-4 hide-scrollbar\">\n\n            <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-[18px] bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-300 via-gray-200 to-gray-100 shadow-2xl shadow-gray-200/50 flex-shrink-0 group\">\n\n                <!-- Main Keyboard Case -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#484A4E] rounded-[17px] p-2.5 shadow-inner\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\">\n\n                    <!-- Inner Case Recess -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#3A3C3F] rounded-xl p-2 flex flex-col gap-1 shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-[#2A2B2D]\">\n\n                        <!-- Row 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1 w-full justify-between\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-1\" id=\"row-1-group-1\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-1\" id=\"row-1-group-2\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-1\" id=\"row-1-group-3\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-1\" id=\"row-1-group-4\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1 w-full\" id=\"row-2\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 3 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1 w-full\" id=\"row-3\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 4 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1 w-full\" id=\"row-4\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 5 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1 w-full relative\" id=\"row-5\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 6 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1 w-full\" id=\"row-6\"></div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Interactive Glow on Hover -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none rounded-[18px]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer Company Logos -->\n        <div class=\"mt-16 flex flex-col items-center gap-5 opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-400 font-semibold\">Featured In</span>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 sm:gap-12 text-gray-400\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 grayscale\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tuning-square-2-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight\">The Verge</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 grayscale\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-5-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-bold tracking-tighter\">Wired</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 grayscale\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ghost-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-wide\">TechCrunch</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Custom hide scrollbar for mobile keyboard wrapper */\n        .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        .hide-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }\n\n        /* Key Base Class simulation for JS injection to keep HTML clean */\n        .key-base {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: flex-start;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            padding: 4px 6px;\n            font-size: 0.65rem; /* ~10px equivalent to text-xs roughly but tighter for layout */\n            line-height: 1;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            border: 1px solid;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            user-select: none;\n            position: relative;\n            transition: all 0.1s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            height: 38px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        .key-base:active {\n            transform: translateY(3px);\n            box-shadow: none !important;\n        }\n\n        .key-base span.sub {\n            font-size: 0.5rem;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n            margin-bottom: 2px;\n            display: block;\n            text-align: center;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .key-base span.main {\n            display: block;\n            text-align: center;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .key-base.align-left { align-items: flex-start; justify-content: flex-end; padding-bottom: 6px; }\n        .key-base.align-left span.main { text-align: left; }\n        .key-base.align-right { align-items: flex-end; justify-content: flex-end; padding-bottom: 6px; }\n        .key-base.align-right span.main { text-align: right; }\n        .key-base.align-center { align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .key-base.align-top-left { align-items: flex-start; justify-content: flex-start; }\n        .key-base.align-top-left span.main { text-align: left; }\n\n        /* Color Themes */\n        .key-orange { background-color: #ED724C; color: white; border-color: #D8613C; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #C55533, 0 4px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }\n        .key-light { background-color: #F8F9FA; color: #374151; border-color: #E5E7EB; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #D1D5DB, 0 4px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }\n        .key-dark { background-color: #7A7C80; color: #F3F4F6; border-color: #6B6D71; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #5A5C60, 0 4px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }\n        .key-mod { background-color: #626468; color: #E5E7EB; border-color: #55575A; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #4A4C50, 0 4px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }\n\n        /* Specific widths */\n        .w-1u { width: 38px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-1-25u { width: 48px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-1-5u { width: 58px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-1-75u { width: 68px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-2u { width: 78px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-2-25u { width: 88px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-2-75u { width: 108px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .w-6-25u { width: 242px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- Keyboard Layout Generation ---\n        const createKey = (text, type, widthCls, alignCls, subText = '') => {\n            const innerHtml = subText\n                ? `<span class=\"sub\">${subText}</span><span class=\"main\">${text}</span>`\n                : `<span class=\"main\">${text}</span>`;\n            return `<div class=\"key-base ${type} ${widthCls} ${alignCls}\">${innerHtml}</div>`;\n        };\n        const icon = (name) => `<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:${name}-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>`;\n        const iconSml = (name) => `<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:${name}-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>`;\n\n        // Row 1\n        document.getElementById('row-1-group-1').innerHTML =\n            createKey('esc', 'key-orange', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left');\n        document.getElementById('row-1-group-2').innerHTML =\n            createKey('F1', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('sun')) +\n            createKey('F2', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('sun-fog')) +\n            createKey('F3', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('monitor')) +\n            createKey('F4', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('card-search'));\n        document.getElementById('row-1-group-3').innerHTML =\n            createKey('F5', 'key-dark', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('microphone')) +\n            createKey('F6', 'key-dark', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('moon')) +\n            createKey('F7', 'key-dark', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('skip-previous')) +\n            createKey('F8', 'key-dark', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('play'));\n        document.getElementById('row-1-group-4').innerHTML =\n            createKey('F9', 'key-dark', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('skip-next')) +\n            createKey('F10', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('volume-cross')) +\n            createKey('F11', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('volume-small')) +\n            createKey('F12', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center', iconSml('volume-loud')) +\n            createKey(icon('hashtag'), 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey('del', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey(icon('lightbulb'), 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center');\n\n        // Row 2\n        document.getElementById('row-2').innerHTML =\n            createKey('`', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '~') +\n            createKey('1', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '!') +\n            createKey('2', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '@') +\n            createKey('3', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '#') +\n            createKey('4', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '$') +\n            createKey('5', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '%') +\n            createKey('6', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '^') +\n            createKey('7', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '&') +\n            createKey('8', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '*') +\n            createKey('9', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '(') +\n            createKey('0', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', ')') +\n            createKey('-', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '_') +\n            createKey('=', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '+') +\n            createKey(icon('arrow-left'), 'key-mod', 'w-2u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey('pgup', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center');\n\n        // Row 3\n        document.getElementById('row-3').innerHTML =\n            createKey('tab', 'key-mod', 'w-1-5u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey('Q', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('W', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('E', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('R', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('T', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('Y', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('U', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('I', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('O', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('P', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('[', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '{') +\n            createKey(']', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '}') +\n            createKey('\\\\', 'key-mod', 'w-1-5u', 'align-top-left', '|') +\n            createKey('pgdn', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center');\n\n        // Row 4\n        document.getElementById('row-4').innerHTML =\n            createKey('caps lock', 'key-mod', 'w-1-75u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey('A', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('S', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('D', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('F', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('G', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('H', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('J', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('K', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('L', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey(';', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', ':') +\n            createKey('\\'', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '\"') +\n            createKey('return', 'key-mod', 'w-2-25u', 'align-right') +\n            createKey('home', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center');\n\n        // Row 5\n        document.getElementById('row-5').innerHTML =\n            createKey('shift', 'key-mod', 'w-2-25u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey('Z', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('X', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('C', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('V', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('B', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('N', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey('M', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left') +\n            createKey(',', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '<') +\n            createKey('.', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '>') +\n            createKey('/', 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-top-left', '?') +\n            createKey('shift', 'key-mod', 'w-1-75u', 'align-right') +\n            createKey(icon('alt-arrow-up'), 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey('end', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-center');\n\n        // Row 6\n        document.getElementById('row-6').innerHTML =\n            createKey('ctrl', 'key-mod', 'w-1-25u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey('option', 'key-mod', 'w-1-25u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey(icon('command'), 'key-mod', 'w-1-25u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey('', 'key-light', 'w-6-25u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey(icon('command'), 'key-mod', 'w-1-25u', 'align-right') +\n            createKey('fn', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey('ctrl', 'key-mod', 'w-1u', 'align-left') +\n            createKey(icon('alt-arrow-left'), 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey(icon('alt-arrow-down'), 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center') +\n            createKey(icon('alt-arrow-right'), 'key-light', 'w-1u', 'align-center');\n\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Staggered Word Reveal\n            const titleElement = document.getElementById('reveal-title');\n            const words = \"Precision Layout. Engineered For Focus.\".split(' ');\n            titleElement.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const spanContainer = document.createElement('span');\n                spanContainer.className = 'overflow-hidden inline-block';\n                const spanWord = document.createElement('span');\n                spanWord.className = 'reveal-word inline-block translate-y-full pb-1';\n                spanWord.innerText = word + '\\u00A0';\n                spanContainer.appendChild(spanWord);\n                titleElement.appendChild(spanContainer);\n            });\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power4.out' } });\n\n            tl.to('#reveal-eyebrow', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                delay: 0.1\n            })\n            .to('.reveal-word', {\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n            }, \"-=0.8\")\n            .to('#reveal-subtitle', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1\n            }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // Keyboard floating animation\n            gsap.to('.group', {\n                y: -10,\n                duration: 3,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- WebGL Background (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create subtle floating particles\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 300;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.015,\n                color: 0x9CA3AF,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n            camera.position.z = 3;\n\n            // Mouse interaction\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n            });\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.002;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.001;\n\n                // Parallax effect\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - particlesMesh.rotation.y);\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - particlesMesh.rotation.x);\n\n                // Gentle wave\n                const positions = particlesMesh.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                for(let i = 1; i < particlesCount * 3; i+=3) {\n                    positions[i] += Math.sin(elapsedTime + positions[i-1]) * 0.001;\n                }\n                particlesMesh.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL after load\n        window.addEventListener('load', initWebGL);\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "typeface-75-premium-mechanical-keyboard-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/typeface-75-premium-mechanical-keyboard-1.jpg", "source_name": "typeface-75-premium-mechanical-keyboard-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 506, "forks": 22, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T19:10:02.931571+00:00"}